  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi, \nA feature that didn't really exist in the mod community because I never took the time to share the code was that I plugged the camera buttons to the action menu buttons. Making me able to zoom with the joystick and switch the camera orientation by a flick of the finger. \nThe current camera system requires two hands to operate when we use it as a handheld cam. Giving us some kind of simple remote controls would be gamechanger.",
